  <p>
    Anne Arundel County offers the best of Maryland living—from the historic streets of Annapolis to the growing communities of Glen Burnie, Severn, Crofton, and Odenton. Home to the U.S. Naval Academy, the Maryland State House, and miles of beautiful Chesapeake Bay shoreline, this county of nearly 600,000 residents has a unique character. Our office is conveniently located just 25 minutes from most Anne Arundel County communities.
  </p>
  <p>
