    As a waterfront county with a thriving tourism industry, Anne Arundel also sees accidents at marinas, restaurants, shopping centers, and recreational facilities. Whether you've been injured at a downtown Annapolis establishment, at Arundel Mills Mall, or at one of the county's many parks and waterfront properties, we can help you pursue compensation for your injuries.
